---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Product Manager with 4+ years in Indonesian fintech — payments, lending, and internal platforms. Based in Jakarta.">

  <!-- Page Heading -->
  <section class="py-16 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        About Me
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg">
        A snapshot of who I am, where I've been, and what I'm building next.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Biographical Summary -->
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6">Bio</h2>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          I'm a Product Manager with 4+ years building fintech and multifinance products in Indonesia — spanning consumer mobile apps, payment integrations, and internal operational platforms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Currently at PT Bussan Auto Finance, I lead end-to-end delivery across two product lines (BAF Mobile and BOSS) with a 19-person cross-functional team. Before that, I owned the lender platform roadmap at Danamas (Sinarmas Group) and shipped payment rail integrations with BNI and Instamoney in a regulated P2P lending environment.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside my day job, I'm building <span class="text-[#2563EB] font-medium">StoryForge.id</span> — an AI-powered BRD analysis tool for Indonesian PMs — using Next.js 14, Supabase, and the Anthropic API. I validated the pain, wrote the PRD, vibe-coded the product, and deployed it myself.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm based in Jakarta and currently open to Senior PM roles in Indonesian fintech and selectively exploring opportunities in Singapore and KL.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Career History -->
  <section class="py-16 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-8">Career History</h2>
      <div class="space-y-0">

        <!-- BAF -->
        <div class="relative pl-6 pb-10 border-l-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 last:border-l-transparent last:pb-0">
          <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#2563EB] border-2 border-white dark:border-[#0f172a]"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">2023 – Present</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-0.5">Product Manager <span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 font-normal text-sm">(Official Title: Product Owner &amp; UI/UX Specialist)</span></h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium mb-3">PT Bussan Auto Finance (BAF)</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">BAF Mobile (consumer app) + BOSS (internal OPS platform)</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Led AyoConnect payment gateway integration. Managed 19-person team across BE, FE, QA, and design.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Danamas -->
        <div class="relative pl-6 pb-10 border-l-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 last:border-l-transparent last:pb-0">
          <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#2563EB] border-2 border-white dark:border-[#0f172a]"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">2022 – 2023</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-0.5">Digital Product Manager</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium mb-3">PT Danamas, Sinarmas Group</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-2">Lender platform (mobile + web) + Jido Gold (0→1)</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Payment rail integrations: BNI, Instamoney. Full roadmap ownership in OJK P2P environment.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- SiCepat -->
        <div class="relative pl-6 pb-10 border-l-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 last:border-l-transparent last:pb-0">
          <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#2563EB] border-2 border-white dark:border-[#0f172a]"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">2021 – 2022</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-0.5">Associate Product Manager</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium mb-3">SiCepat Ekspres Indonesia</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">First-mile outlet platform + driver management app (mobile + web)</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pre-PM -->
        <div class="relative pl-6 pb-10 border-l-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 last:border-l-transparent last:pb-0">
          <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-slate-300 dark:bg-slate-600 border-2 border-white dark:border-[#0f172a]"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">2017 – 2021</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-0.5">Technical Writer & System Analyst</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium mb-3">Pegadaian (via Avows), WebCenter, Gauri Optima Sukses</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Education -->
        <div class="relative pl-6 border-l-2 border-transparent">
          <div class="absolute -left-[9px] top-0 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-slate-200 dark:bg-slate-700 border-2 border-white dark:border-[#0f172a]"></div>
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Education</p>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-0.5">B.Sc. Information Technology</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm font-medium">UIN Sultan Syarif Kasim Riau</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What I'm Looking For -->
  <section class="py-16 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-8">What I'm Looking For</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">

        <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-white/5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Role</p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Senior PM or Lead PM roles in fintech — ideally in lending, payments, or investment products.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-white/5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Indonesia</p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Fast-moving regulated fintech companies in multifinance, P2P lending, or neo-banking.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-white/5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">SEA — 18–24 month horizon</p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Product roles at fintech infrastructure, digital banking, or wealthtech companies in Singapore or Kuala Lumpur.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-white/5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2563EB] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">What matters to me</p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Outcome ownership, real user exposure, and an environment where product decisions are driven by data and user insight — not by whoever spoke last in the steering committee.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            I'm not looking for another execution-only role. I want to own strategy, talk to users, and ship things I'm proud of in five years.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- StoryForge.id -->
  <section class="py-16 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between gap-4 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">StoryForge.id</h2>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 text-sm">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
          Launching soon
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
        <p>
          StoryForge.id is an AI-powered BRD analysis tool built for Indonesian Product Managers. It reads your BRD, identifies gaps, ambiguities, and missing business rules, then generates a structured Q&amp;A list you can send to Business Enablement — in Bahasa Indonesia, ready to send.
        </p>
        <p>
          I built it solo in ~10 hours/week alongside a full-time PM role. Pain validated with 4 PMs, 3 willing to pay. Approaching beta launch with first paying user.
        </p>
        <p class="italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
          This project exists because I lived the pain it solves. Every week I spent hours reconstructing requirements that should have been written before they reached me. StoryForge is what I wish I'd had on day one.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stack tags -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {['Next.js 14', 'Supabase', 'Anthropic API (claude-haiku)', 'Vercel', 'Upstash QStash'].map(tech => (
          <span class="px-3 py-1 border border-[#2563EB]/20 text-[#2563EB] dark:text-blue-400 text-xs rounded-full font-medium bg-[#2563EB]/5">
            {tech}
          </span>
        ))}
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
